I have been a fan of Asimov's World Seasonal Calender ever since it was
first proposed.  I think that this calendar would work perfectly with the
premise of lojban.  Using this calendar, the date-keeping protocol can be
streamlined to year, season [A-D], week [1-13], day [1-7].

mi'e mu'o brais

